Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.29,0:00:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau baik-baik saja, Takemitchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kulihat Senju mati di sini, melindungiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi aku berhasil menghentikannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Salah satu masa depan terburuk berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baguslah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kita juga harus pergi dari sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kau benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takemichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beri tahu Mikey sesuatu untukku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katakan padanya jangan membuatku\Nterlalu mencemaskannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.43,0:01:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya bisa sejauh ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}#58 Kembalikan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}{\i1}Tak terdengar apa pun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Tanganku juga tak berfungsi dengan baik.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Langit mulai tampak kabur.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.44,0:03:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.27,0:03:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kupanggil ambulans!\NHanagaki, terus ajak dia bicara.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buat dia terus sadar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.37,0:03:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken, Draken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa ekspresimu begitu, Takemitchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.71,0:03:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ambulans menuju ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau akan baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.01,0:03:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pasti selamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.81,0:03:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ini saatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.15,0:04:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.74,0:04:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bicara apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Besok kau akan sembuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena kau Draken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takemitchy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan salahkan dirimu sendiri, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini terjadi bukan karena kau\Nkembali ke masa lalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau memberiku kehidupan ini,\Ndan kini kuberikan hidupku untukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:04:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paham?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat SD,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku selalu berkelahi dan kalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:32.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena aku selalu melawan\Nanak-anak yang lebih tua.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.08,0:05:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kalah bertarung,\Nakhirnya terkapar di tanah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi saat kulihat langit seperti ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}entah kenapa, semua itu tak penting lagi,\Ndan aku akan merasa lebih baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.11,0:06:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mikey tak tahu langit ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak pernah kalah itu sulit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takemitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat menyukainya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dia menanggung semuanya sendiri...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Dan entah bagaimana dia masih bertahan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan di balik itu, dia masih bocah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku selalu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mengamatinya dari punggungnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya aku mau memperbaiki ini demi dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Takemitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh kukatakan satu hal payah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:14.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.43,0:07:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jaga Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Tingkat kesadaran 20.\N- Kau baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami mengantarmu masuk ambulans sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.31,0:08:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke laut!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat Tahun Baru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan Olympus Harajuku?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:14.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Divisi Satu mengalahkan\Nmusuh-musuh kecil itu sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, Chifuyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa pun yang mengganggu Baji,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kulucuti dan kuhajar habis-habisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau selalu keterlaluan\Nmenuruti perintah Baji.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nitoro di Akasaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.26,0:08:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama musnah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar, Angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.89,0:08:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Smiley berlebihan, aku sibuk menahannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toman makin besar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena bos kita yang terkuat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mikey makin intens belakangan ini, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, tak ada yang bisa menghentikannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia wajah Toman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mikey yang Perkasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya dia agak menjauh sekarang, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agak menyedihkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kurasa begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau masih punya aku, Taka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matahari terbitnya tak terkejar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian kura-kura?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sampai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat semua bintangnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kujūkuri dingin sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Chifuyu, Hakkai,\Nbeli makanan panas di toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bisa mati beku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Baik!\N- Siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu. Ini baru pukul 04.00.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kapan matahari terbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:41.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dingin sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.53,0:09:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sampai kehilangan semangat hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.62,0:09:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ayo lari! Lari!\N- Kau bercanda, Draken?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa Divisi Lima belum datang?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kata Mucho, berkendara ke sini merepotkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.59,0:09:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kubunuh pria tua itu, sungguh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Smiley, bicaramu kasar sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pah-chin, jangan tidur. Kau akan mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah bangun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.93,0:10:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami kembali dari toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang mereka lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:12.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Senior punya banyak energi.\N- Badanku jadi hangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku lelah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.78,0:10:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makin terang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matahari terbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matahari terbit pertama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Pah-chin, bangun!\N- Kubilang sudah, Berengsek!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenchin...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita akan menguasai seluruh dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahun ini, kita menaklukkan negara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku datang, Emma.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia akan selamat, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:20.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita baru saja kehilangan dia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.22,0:12:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkeliaran melakukan hal tak perlu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau menembak Draken?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang kau pikirkan? Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.69,0:13:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami hanya... Hanaga...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata mereka mantan anggota Toman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.87,0:13:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Mereka dipenjara karena Hanagaki.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat keluar, mereka tahu\Ndia orang penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.04,0:13:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka menyimpan dendam\Ntak masuk akal terhadapnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga, mereka melakukan\Nhal yang amat ceroboh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kini bos hilang akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.39,0:13:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu bukan kehilangan akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian sungguh melakukannya, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.66,0:13:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih ada peluru tersisa di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senju, benarkah Draken dibunuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.27,0:15:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang terjadi, Senju?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang menarik pelatuknya mungkin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pembunuh bayaran\Ndari Rokuhara atau Kanto Manji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya, targetnya\Nadalah Takemichi Hanagaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryuguji menjadi tamengnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini salahku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:19.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang mengajak\NHanagaki ke taman hiburan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa ke tempat seperti itu?\NAda urusan apa...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa Senju juga\Npunya kecemasan sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Kecemasan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya ada teman seusianya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang bisa diajak bicara\Nsoal hal yang kita...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:36.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong kosong sentimental apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau paham betapa pentingnya\Nmomen ini bagi Brahman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senju juga tahu itu. Hanya saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya ada yang mau kau katakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa karena itu sikapmu\Ndengan klien amat buruk?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak perlu memikirkan apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.42,0:16:05.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lakukan saja perintahku. Itu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kubilang sejak awal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.96,0:16:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa jadi begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami jauh-jauh kemari\Nuntuk "requiem" Draken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Salah satu orangku menembaknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih baik menyelesaikan masalah\Ndengan cepat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:44.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kutunggu\Nsampai pasukanmu berkumpul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita mulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Armageddon, perang terakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benkei, panggil semua orang\Nuntuk pertemuan darurat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.30,0:16:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita hancurkan Rokuhara Tandai,\Nmulai sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senju...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan hari ini, Takeomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Lalu kapan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.11,0:17:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah, tapi jangan hari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kita mundur begitu saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.86,0:17:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Draken sudah mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengar, Senju.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:24.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini bukan perkelahian bocah\Nsoal siapa yang terkuat lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini pertarungan maut!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa pun yang kau inginkan,\Ntak ada jalan kembali sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti kita harus membunuh juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.05,0:17:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rokuhara yang menghancurkan semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:37.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada opsi lain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.93,0:17:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kita mundur sekarang,\Ntim ini akan tamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita tak bisa membiarkan itu terjadi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Senju!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:17:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}South.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:18.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi aku, pulanglah untuk hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika mau, ayo satu lawan satu,\NSenju yang Tak Terkalahkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:32.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:41.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kematian Draken adalah kesalahanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:50.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kesalahanku. Kemalangan ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan mendekat, Takeomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan melarangmu memukul\Nperempuan yang takkan melawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena Senju adalah bos kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.15,0:19:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bukan ini\Nyang kau inginkan, 'kan, South?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau punya satu malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masuklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.99,0:20:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya Ken Ryuguji meninggal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.57,0:22:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}#8
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Canggung juga. Apa yang harus kubicarakan?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.34,0:23:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Ratu akhirnya keluar dari kamarnya,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}tapi jika terus begini, dia akan...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.76,0:23:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kucing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:57.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ratu, kau suka kucing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:24:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, apa ada kucing yang lewat sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.18,0:24:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pangeran, ada kucing di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga dia di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:07.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf. Aku akan segera membawanya pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.36,0:24:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\i1}Apa Ratu akan menangis?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.86,0:24:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pangeran, apa kau bisa memberi kucing itu\Nkepada kami?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.78,0:24:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak bisa menyerahkannya\Nbegitu saja seperti benda, Bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.71,0:24:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Lepaskan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}{\an8}Diterjemahkan oleh Lia Agatha
